      "titleHtml": "Đọc <ruby>例文<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> (ví dụ)",
      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111110102.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>１．  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai9_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>お<ruby>酒<rp>(</rp><rt>さけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>Anh/chị có thích rượu không?<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;いいえ、<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きじゃ ありません。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>&hellip;Không, tôi không thích lắm.<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>2．</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai9_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>どんな スポーツが <ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>Anh/chị thích môn thể thao nào?<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;サッカーが <ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きです。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>&hellip;Tôi thích môn bóng đá<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>3．</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai9_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>カリナさんは <ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>上手<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>Chị Karina có giỏi hội họa không?<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;はい、「カリナさんは」 とても <ruby>上手<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>&hellip;Có, chị ấy rất giỏi.<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>4．</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai9_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>田中<rp>(</rp><rt>たなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんは <ruby>インドネシア<rp>(</rp><rt>いんどねしあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が わかりますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>Anh Tanaka có hiểu tiếng Indonesia không?<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></div></div><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;いいえ、<ruby>全然<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> わかりません。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Không, tôi không biết chút nào cả.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>5．</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai9_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>細<rp>(</rp><rt>こま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かい お<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Anh/chị có tiền lẻ không?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;いいえ、ありません。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Không, tôi không có.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>6．</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai9_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>毎朝<rp>(</rp><rt>まいあさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>新聞<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Mỗi sáng anh/chị có đọc báo không?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;いいえ、<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありませんから、<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みません。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Không. V&igrave; không có thời gian nên tôi không đọc.</div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>7．</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span>  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai9_rb_7.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>どうして きのう <ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>はや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く <ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tại sao hôm qua anh/chị về sớm?</div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; <ruby>用事<rp>(</rp><rt>ようじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありましたから。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;V&igrave; tôi có việc bận.</div></div></div></p> <p> </div>",
